From 5757401dd209270043110bdfbd67178393277e3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Voqii <codylepine4@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:33:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] 2.3.13-voqii: potions in kits load on MC 1.20.5+

PotionType.getByEffect returns the LONG_/STRONG_ variant on modern servers, so
new PotionData(type, extended, upgraded) threw for most potions (Swiftness,
Strength, Regeneration, Poison, any level II potion...) and the whole kit
failed to load in /kp kit and /kp preview. The base potion type is now set by
name, and new kits save the potion type itself so Turtle Master and plain
water/awkward bottles survive too. Older kit files still load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pom.xml                                       |  2 +-
 .../kitpvp/item/AttributeParser.java          | 33 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../kitpvp/item/AttributeWriter.java          | 29 ++++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pom.xml b/pom.xml
index 10f59fe..46b5ae8 100644
--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
 
     <groupId>com.planetgallium</groupId>
     <artifactId>KitPvP</artifactId>
-    <version>2.3.13</version>
+    <version>2.3.13-voqii</version>
     <packaging>jar</packaging>
 
     <name>${project.artifactId}</name>
diff --git a/src/main/java/com/planetgallium/kitpvp/item/AttributeParser.java b/src/main/java/com/planetgallium/kitpvp/item/AttributeParser.java
